nted at you. Mass is mass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T13:44:14-07:00","id":970889,"title":"","content":"From looking at it it seems you just need a single hit for this embed to break an item.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T14:02:54-07:00","id":970899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/968493-1001-gadgets?p=970889#post970889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From looking at it it seems you just need a single hit for this embed to break an item.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but the suit isn't really &quot;hitting&quot; the bullets (except in the sense of physics).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T16:17:51-07:00","id":970967,"title":"","content":"59) <b>Hallowguise (Context Matters):</b> This cheap Halloween costume causes anyone wearing it to look like they're wearing a cheap Halloween costume. No matter how they actually look. A bloodstained ogre wearing this costume looks like a man in a store-bought shrek outfit covered in ketchup. An Unchained in Demonic Form wearing it looks like they made an Optimus Prime costume out of cardboard boxes and toilet paper rolls. Unfortunately, the gadget is only about as durable as a cheap Halloween costume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-16T16:48:29-07:00","id":970978,"title":"","content":"60)<br /> <b>Name:</b> Loom<br /> <b>Embed Used: </b>Quick Change<br /> <b>Activation and Trigger: </b>Pulling a Hidden Lever <br /> <b>Effect: </b>The Gadget was Designed to create custom clothing of any-type. Be it armor, cosplay or anything else with in seconds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T10:13:19-07:00","id":974488,"title":"","content":"61) <br /> <b>Name:</b> Knockout Gas<br /> <b>Embed Used: </b>Knockout Punch<br /> <b>Activation and Trigger: </b>Turning the pin 90 degrees and pulling the pin<br /> <b>Effect: </b>The gas from the grande leaves no trace but anyone who breaths in the gas is knocked out for the next 24 hours and 1 second.<br /> <br /> 62) <br /> <b>Name:</b> Fake Death Grenade <br /> <b>Embed Used: </b>Play Possum<br /> <b>Activation and Trigger: </b>Turning the pin 90 degrees and pulling the pin<br /> <b>Effect: </b>The gas from the grande leaves no trace but anyone who breaths in the gas is put into a death like state for a few hours. <br /> <br /> 63) This is not a gadget but a new class I'm calling Dooms Day Gadget (This more of a device used by bad guys like a laser on the moon type of deal)<br /> <b>Name:</b> Death Ray<br /> <b>Exploits Used: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Hellfire + Disintegrate</span></span><br /> <b>Activation and Trigger: </b>Mechanical Laughter and pushing a big red button<br /> <b>Effect: </b>When this device is turned on it says ominous hum and fires a large blue beam that completely destroys anything in its path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T10:31:16-07:00","id":974505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/968493-1001-gadgets?p=974488#post974488\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">63) This is not a gadget but a new class I'm calling Dooms Day Gadget (This more of a device used by bad guys like a laser on the moon type of deal)<br /> <b>Name:</b> Death Ray<br /> <b>Exploits Used: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Hellfire + Disintegrate</span></span><br /> <b>Activation and Trigger: </b>Mechanical Laughter and pushing a big red button<br /> <b>Effect: </b>When this device is turned on it says ominous hum and fires a large blue beam that completely destroys anything in its path.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a Lambda, and there's a thread for that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm not sure Hellfire and Disintegrate really combine all that well. I think the Aggravated damage from Hellfire can accomplish most of what Disintegrate can. Maybe they could work in tandem? Disintegrate gets rid of anything in front of the shot, until it encounters living matter (which Disintegrate doesn't affect), where-upon the shot deals Aggravated Damage (as normal for Hellfire). But that's just two separate, sequential uses, rather than a fusion of two powers. <hr /><br /> <b>Name:</b> Normality Rounds<br /> <b>Type:</b> Embeded (Going Native), One-Shot[, Near-Field?]<br /> <b>Activation:</b> Whispering &quot;Only Human&quot;, to the rounds before firing.<br /> <b>Appearance:</b> Standard for ammunition of their type, except for the scratching that resembles Da Vinci's Vitruivian Man on their casings.<br /> <b>Effect:</b> When a supernatural, human-like (or at least, human-seeming) being is stuck by these rounds, they find themselves severed from their supernatural powers, as if they were only the human they appeared to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 09-22-2016, 02:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-08T15:51:23-07:00","id":984097,"title":"","content":"64) <br /> <b>Name:</b> Up My Sleeve<br /> <b>Embed Used:</b> In My Pocket<br /> <b>Activation and Trigger:</b> Hand Sign Of the Owners Choosing<br /> <b>Effect:</b> Once the user makes their chosen hand sign the weapon they want will slide down their sleeve into their hand","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby"